  "summary": "Evolving social-engineering campaign in which fake AI, gaming and Web3 startup companies contact cryptocurrency users over X, Telegram or Discord with a registration code and direct them to Electron apps (Windows) or DMG installers (macOS). Windows builds profile the host (HWID, MAC, GPU, RAM) and pull remote EXEs/MSIs signed with stolen code-signing certificates, while macOS builds run Atomic Stealer plus a LaunchAgent-persisted InstallerHelper that exfiltrate browser and crypto-wallet data. Stolen data is POSTed to 45.94.47.167/contact and metrics are sent to mrajhhoshoahjsd.com/collect-metrics.",
